  user_input {
    user_response: "I want to build an app for my IBDP Geography class. The app will be a essay planning app. \n\nIt will have an area where i type the essay question. Either 10, 12 or 16 mark essay question. It will have another input for the definition of a key term/s i want to define in the essay introduction. It will then have a section where i prompt suggested body paragraph focusses, making it somewhat manual requiring student intelect before a response is generated. There will be a box that i can type a number of concepts or perspectives i want to be included in the response. It will also have a section where i encourage it to respond in PEEL (POINT, EVIDENCE, EXPLAIN LINK) or PEECAL (POINT, EVIDENCE EXPLAIN, COUNTER ARGUMENT, ANALYSIS, LINK). It will also have an area where i can upload sources, either web links or pdf, ppt or docs / word docs to guide content that i want included e.g. lesson content or case studies. \n\nThe last box will suggest how the conclusion should be e.g. conclusion should be \'i agree to a large extent that\' "
    items {
      text: "I want to build an app for my IBDP Geography class. The app will be a essay planning app. \n\nIt will have an area where i type the essay question. Either 10, 12 or 16 mark essay question. It will have another input for the definition of a key term/s i want to define in the essay introduction. It will then have a section where i prompt suggested body paragraph focusses, making it somewhat manual requiring student intelect before a response is generated. There will be a box that i can type a number of concepts or perspectives i want to be included in the response. It will also have a section where i encourage it to respond in PEEL (POINT, EVIDENCE, EXPLAIN LINK) or PEECAL (POINT, EVIDENCE EXPLAIN, COUNTER ARGUMENT, ANALYSIS, LINK). It will also have an area where i can upload sources, either web links or pdf, ppt or docs / word docs to guide content that i want included e.g. lesson content or case studies. \n\nThe last box will suggest how the conclusion should be e.g. conclusion should be \'i agree to a large extent that\' "
