  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing the Geography App**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the core structure: an IBDP Geography essay planning app. My thoughts are crystalizing around the essential features. I\'ve got the essay question input sorted, differentiating for 10, 12, or 16 marks. I\'m also planning the framework for key term definitions, to go in the intro. Lastly, I\'m thinking about the suggested body paragraph focus.\n\n\n**Refining App Features**\n\nNow, I\'m integrating features like manual paragraph theme input and specific geographic concepts. Users will choose between PEEL or PEECAL structures. I\'m also adding support for web links, document uploads, and a conclusion guide. I\'ll utilize Gemini API for document processing and AI-generated essay plans based on input. I need to make the UI modules, including a question section for a title and question.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will build a professional, academic-focused **IBDP Geography Essay Planner**. \n\nThe app will feature a structured multi-step interface to guide students through the intellectual process of planning high-level geography essays. It will support:\n- **Question Analysis**: Selecting mark schemes (10, 12, 16) and defining key terms.\n- **Structural Framing**: Choosing between PEEL and PEECAL frameworks.\n- **Case Study Integration**: Uploading sources (PDFs, PPTs, Docs) and URLs to ground the essay in evidence.\n- **AI-Powered Synthesis**: Using Gemini to generate a detailed, structured essay plan based on the student\'s manual inputs, ensuring \"student intellect\" remains at the core.\n\n### \360\237\233\240 Plan\n1. **Initialize Metadata**: Give the app a professional name and description.\n2. **Setup Dependencies**: Install `react-dropzone` for file uploads and `clsx` / `tailwind-merge` for styling.\n3. **Core UI Construction**: \n    - A clean \"Geography-toned\" interface (using earth tones and academic typography).\n    - Dynamic forms for paragraph focuses and concepts.\n    - File upload handling logic.\n4. **AI Integration**: Implement a Gemini-powered service to process textual inputs and uploaded documents (using `gemini-api` skill patterns) to provide the final essay plan.\n\nLet\'s start by updating the metadata and installing the necessary packages.\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 924920234
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
