    thinking: "**Integrating Conceptual Pillars**\n\nThe applet compiles and lints without issues; that\'s good. I\'ve now integrated the 4Ps and 2Ss conceptual pillars into the planning interface, as was required. Also, I updated the AI instruction set so that it considers these themes when it generates essay roadmaps.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I\'ve updated the **Geography Essay Architect** to include the core IB Geography conceptual pillars you requested. \n\n### What\'s New:\n*   **Conceptual Pillars (4Ps & 2Ss):** You can now select specific pillars (**Place, Process, Power, Possibilities** and **Scale, Spatial Interaction**) during the planning phase.\n*   **Engine Guidance:** The AI prompt has been redesigned to explicitly use these selected pillars as analytical lenses. It will now suggest exactly how to apply a specific pillar (e.g., *Power*) to a specific body paragraph.\n*   **Academic Depth:** I\'ve updated the underlying model to a more stable pro version to ensure the evidentiary depth matches the specific requirements of 10, 12, and 16-mark IB mark schemes.\n\nYou can now toggle these pillars in the **Manual Planning** step to influence the \"direction of travel\" for your essay roadmap."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 72745372
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\301\006\n\276\006\001\f9\326\307\230L\202\305w\317\020\232.\202\003\263\371\351=x\342\032P\323{7A\321\215?\314\034\017\334\262U u\303\352\2422@\224\200\205\342\245B\202\301\223\210\026\033GE\371w&\340\021a\263M\001o$\017\373\250#\214+S\274f\342\002\351\t\363W3\030`\325!\303\177\202\266n\372\005Y\3166v\373\372lrG\217\365S\024\237\273\236\314r\"\264i\025n7\304\304\t\364+\274\305o\354\220P\r\234[\330L\021G\374-\v\fO5\231D\201-\376[\260\254\004D\242\253\355\024x<\025a\001\201I\226\311\236\277(\230LwR\330xY.\350\233\270\262\236\250o;\004Q\273\220\2738bu~a\t\300+\213&h\242I6[;\310\356u~\223\315\024p\201\017\026Vv\\\027\352.\205\226O\232\311\260j\220\346\017\214\321\037\274d\232V\031*\274\217\361:l\213\026\261\235\nF8X\230\337\242me}JoYwM\336Y\3401\220\255\236/\316\224Iff\205:\032t\310\n\246\263\231Z\237\347\004\230\215,\354\310}\374\256d\206^\344+R\246>\262\321\375\352\252+\a\024(\224\337\024M\247r\223\231W+$s[\201\024\225w\222RK\311\314\n\251[\326\272I\270\004\232\205\tB{\310\303\2779d\314\362I\250\321\270\353\235u\357c\277#\002\356\002\027\351\346\245\335\2772C\301\b0\350\261@]\207i\003\371E\244\247\0356a\314*n\376\a\371M\273\315D&\246\237\220]fr\327b\t\260\351\200\023\275\227\f\023\216\030\357\005C\362/\331\036\204K\360_\023\002\207[\264\277fE&\331\376\334\242b\t\r.\227\254\212\341\253j\272\213b\316a\375\227B\210\206\230$\033Y\035\006\322\203\343\005\220e7B\377\206/Z\0273\317\323\336v\316\312\365\343\351\263H\211\r\211\243\020\305s\265\004]\255jS\036:\33263\315\217P\004g\251#Ow8vk\227\033:g\327O\206)\307a\025B1I\252\250:\257D\317\364\3271\274G\030h:\324T\373\241nR{v\302\260z7\3679.\020\n\203\204\331\016\347yPf\225\341\243\341\220o\271a\336d\t\340\267\341g\276;\313%\314\021\203h\001\241\004\325B-\250e1.E\2111\f\021\vP\263\f\006\342\313a\373 \004\340\361\032GO\225X\301~\331\025i\236\210\364l\356\032B`g\302;\244,\r\246\214\330\035\2024V\341=C\355\333\344b\241\323c\206r\t\376\270\376\322\241ba\211\n\356\265\365\214\301+?\\\373\352E\364\223\221