  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html>\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 font-sans p-8 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b-2 border-slate-900 pb-4 mb-8\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">GeoStrategy</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">IBDP Geography Essay Planning Studio</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-400\\\">Session Code</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-mono font-bold\\\">IB-GEO-2024-08</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 flex-1\\\">\\n    <!-- Left Column: The Foundation -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-slate-500\\\">01. Essay Question</label>\\n        <textarea class=\\\"w-full h-32 text-sm leading-relaxed border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 font-medium resize-none\\\" placeholder=\\\"Type your essay prompt here...\\\">Evaluate the role of management strategies in one or more arid environments. To what extent are these strategies sustainable in the long-term?</textarea>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex mt-4 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-black border border-slate-900\\\">10 MARKS</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-black border border-slate-900\\\">12 MARKS</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-black border border-slate-900 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">16 MARKS</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-slate-500\\\">02. Key Term Definitions</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-b border-slate-100 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase block\\\">Aridity</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs italic\\\">Extreme dryness where potential evapotranspiration exceeds precipitation.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-b border-slate-100 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase block\\\">Sustainability</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs italic\\\">Meeting needs of the present without compromising future generations.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <textarea class=\\\"w-full text-xs border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 mt-2 h-16 resize-none\\\" placeholder=\\\"Add another term...\\\"></textarea>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Middle Column: The Argument -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-4 text-slate-500\\\">03. Body Paragraph Focuses</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold\\\">P1</span>\\n            <input class=\\\"flex-1 text-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\" value=\\\"Water irrigation techniques in the Negev Desert (Israel)\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold\\\">P2</span>\\n            <input class=\\\"flex-1 text-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\" value=\\\"Mineral extraction management in Atacama (Chile)\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold\\\">P3</span>\\n            <input class=\\\"flex-1 text-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\" placeholder=\\\"Add paragraph focus...\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-8\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-slate-500\\\">04. Concepts & Perspectives</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">SCALE</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">POSSIBILISM</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">POWER DYNAMICS</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-300 text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">+ ADD CONCEPT</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <textarea class=\\\"w-full mt-4 text-sm bg-slate-50 p-3 h-24 border-none focus:ring-0 rounded-sm italic\\\" placeholder=\\\"Describe how these integrate into your argument...\\\">Evaluate from the perspective of both local nomadic populations and state governments.</textarea>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Column: Framework & Sources -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3 text-slate-500\\\">05. Essay Framework</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"py-2 border border-slate-300 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">PEEL</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"py-2 border-2 border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">PEECAL</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3 text-slate-500\\\">06. Source Materials</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-red-400\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-medium truncate\\\">Negev_Study.pdf</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-blue-400\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-medium truncate\\\">Lesson_Notes.pptx</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">+ UPLOAD SOURCE</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-emerald-50 border-2 border-emerald-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(6,78,59,1)] flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-emerald-900\\\">07. Conclusion Strategy</label>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs font-serif leading-relaxed text-emerald-900 opacity-80 mb-4\\\">\\n          Final judgment should evaluate the spatial variations in management success.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-emerald-900/20 p-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 italic\\\">\\n          \\\"I agree to a large extent that management strategies succeed when local stakeholders are involved, however...\\\"\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"mt-8 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">AUTOSAVED AT 14:32</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">READABILITY: HIGH</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <button class=\\\"bg-emerald-500 text-slate-900 px-6 py-3 border-2 border-slate-900 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] active:translate-x-1 active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n      Generate Essay Outline\\n    </button>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html>\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 font-sans p-8 overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Section -->\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end border-b-2 border-slate-900 pb-4 mb-8\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase\\\">GeoStrategy</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-500 uppercase\\\">IBDP Geography Essay Planning Studio</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-slate-400\\\">Session Code</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-mono font-bold\\\">IB-GEO-2024-08</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 flex-1\\\">\\n    <!-- Left Column: The Foundation -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-slate-500\\\">01. Essay Question</label>\\n        <textarea class=\\\"w-full h-32 text-sm leading-relaxed border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 font-medium resize-none\\\" placeholder=\\\"Type your essay prompt here...\\\">Evaluate the role of management strategies in one or more arid environments. To what extent are these strategies sustainable in the long-term?</textarea>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex mt-4 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-black border border-slate-900\\\">10 MARKS</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-black border border-slate-900\\\">12 MARKS</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-black border border-slate-900 shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">16 MARKS</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-slate-500\\\">02. Key Term Definitions</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-b border-slate-100 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase block\\\">Aridity</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs italic\\\">Extreme dryness where potential evapotranspiration exceeds precipitation.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-b border-slate-100 pb-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-600 uppercase block\\\">Sustainability</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs italic\\\">Meeting needs of the present without compromising future generations.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <textarea class=\\\"w-full text-xs border-none focus:ring-0 p-0 mt-2 h-16 resize-none\\\" placeholder=\\\"Add another term...\\\"></textarea>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Middle Column: The Argument -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-4 text-slate-500\\\">03. Body Paragraph Focuses</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold\\\">P1</span>\\n            <input class=\\\"flex-1 text-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\" value=\\\"Water irrigation techniques in the Negev Desert (Israel)\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold\\\">P2</span>\\n            <input class=\\\"flex-1 text-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\" value=\\\"Mineral extraction management in Atacama (Chile)\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold\\\">P3</span>\\n            <input class=\\\"flex-1 text-sm border-b border-slate-200 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500\\\" placeholder=\\\"Add paragraph focus...\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-8\\\">\\n          <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-slate-500\\\">04. Concepts & Perspectives</label>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">SCALE</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">POSSIBILISM</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">POWER DYNAMICS</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-slate-300 text-slate-400 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">+ ADD CONCEPT</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <textarea class=\\\"w-full mt-4 text-sm bg-slate-50 p-3 h-24 border-none focus:ring-0 rounded-sm italic\\\" placeholder=\\\"Describe how these integrate into your argument...\\\">Evaluate from the perspective of both local nomadic populations and state governments.</textarea>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Column: Framework & Sources -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3 text-slate-500\\\">05. Essay Framework</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"py-2 border border-slate-300 text-[10px] font-bold\\\">PEEL</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"py-2 border-2 border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 text-white text-[10px] font-bold\\\">PEECAL</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border-2 border-slate-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)]\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3 text-slate-500\\\">06. Source Materials</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-red-400\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-medium truncate\\\">Negev_Study.pdf</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-blue-400\\\"></div>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-medium truncate\\\">Lesson_Notes.pptx</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">+ UPLOAD SOURCE</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-emerald-50 border-2 border-emerald-900 p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(6,78,59,1)] flex-1\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2 text-emerald-900\\\">07. Conclusion Strategy</label>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs font-serif leading-relaxed text-emerald-900 opacity-80 mb-4\\\">\\n          Final judgment should evaluate the spatial variations in management success.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-emerald-900/20 p-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 italic\\\">\\n          \\\"I agree to a large extent that management strategies succeed when local stakeholders are involved, however...\\\"\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"mt-8 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">AUTOSAVED AT 14:32</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400\\\">READABILITY: HIGH</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <button class=\\\"bg-emerald-500 text-slate-900 px-6 py-3 border-2 border-slate-900 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(15,23,42,1)] active:translate-x-1 active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n      Generate Essay Outline\\n    </button>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
