  planner_response {
    modified_response: "To set your API key, follow these steps in the Google AI Studio interface:\n\n1. Click on the **Settings** (gear icon) in the bottom-left or top-right of the screen.\n2. Look for the **Secrets** or **Environment Variables** section.\n3. Add a new secret with the name **`GEMINI_API_KEY`**.\n4. Paste your Google AI Gemini API key into the value field.\n5. Save the secret.\n\nThe application is already configured to automatically pick up this key from the environment. Once added, you should be able to generate your essay plans!"
