  planner_response {
    modified_response: "The application is fully built and ready for your IBDP Geography class. I\'ve implemented the **Geometric Balance** design theme, giving it a professional, structured \"planning studio\" aesthetic with a high-contrast slate and emerald color palette.\n\n### Key Features Integrated:\n- **Guided Essay Steps**: A structured multi-step process: Question Analysis \342\206\222 Manual Planning \342\206\222 Evidence/Sources \342\206\222 Conclusion Stance.\n- **Academic Frameworks**: Fully supports **PEEL** and **PEECAL** (optimized for 16-mark essays) structure selection.\n- **IB Core Pillars**: Added explicit toggles for **Place, Process, Power, Possibilities** (4Ps) and **Scale, Spatial Interaction** (2S) to ground your analysis.\n- **Document Analysis**: Supports uploading PDFs, Word docs, and PowerPoint files to guide the AI with your specific lesson notes or case studies.\n- **Mark-Scheme Awareness**: Tailors the depth of the generated plan based on whether it is a 10, 12, or 16-mark question.\n\n### Regarding your API Key:\nLooking at your screenshot, you have successfully added the `GEMINI_API_KEY` in the Secrets panel. **You are all set.** The application is configured to automatically pull that key at runtime to power the essay generation.\n\n### How to use:\n1. **Input your question** and choose the marks (10, 12, or 16).\n2. **Define key terms** to set the scene for the introduction.\n3. **Draft your body paragraph focuses** manually\342\200\224this ensures you maintain intellectual control.\n4. **Select the 4P/2S pillars** you want to emphasize.\n5. **Upload case study files** if you have specific data you want included.\n6. **Set your conclusion stance** (e.g., \"I agree to a large extent...\").\n7. **Generate**: The app will synthesize a detailed Markdown outline that you can then use to write your full response.\n\nThe app is \"good to go\"\342\200\224you can access it via the **Shared App URL** provided in the metadata."
